{"_note":"bundleId → App 解析(/manage 页收 ?bundleId= 预填时调用,asc 的「在观察哨关注」跳转链路):lookup 支持 ?bundleId= 反查,输出与 search.df 的行同形({id,n,dev}),JS 直接走既有 addApp。\n【G23 豁免】跳转携参才跑、一次性、结果要新鲜,缓存有害(与 search.df 同理)。","_lintCache":"exempt","version":1,"actions":[{"id":"resp","action":"request","params":{"url":"https://itunes.apple.com/lookup?bundleId=${bid}&country=${country}","method":"GET","formatType":"json"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"total","value":"$[length::(${resp.results})]"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"id","value":"${resp.results[0].trackId}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"n","value":"${resp.results[0].trackName}"}},{"op":"set","props":{"key":"dev","value":"${resp.results[0].artistName}"}},{"action":"resultFilter","params":{"keys":["total","id","n","dev"]}}]}
